# Hand-written test/seed content for the Crest.Admin.Client context (WASM .Admin's
# CrestApiLocalizer, served via GET api/crest/localization/strings - see
# plans/user-localization.md's "Client string localization for .Admin"). Backs
# localization-sequential-settings.js's exercise of the full resolution chain, and gives
# real editorial content for keys already converted in AdminMenus.razor (the
# proof-of-concept file; keys are invariant literals, T["..."] native style). Mirrored under
# modules/OrchardCore.Crest/tests/playwright/fixtures/crest-admin-client/ for the test
# suite's own reference copy - see that directory's README.
